# Auto-Critic Validation Gate

**Mandatory before completing any implementation work.**

## Must pass

- Build/compile (if project has one)
- Typecheck (if project has one)
- Lint — zero new errors

Max 2 fix cycles, then escalate to architect review.

## Also check

- Spec adherence against `.scratch/` plan
- Path safety (verified paths only)
- Risk assessment (Low/Medium/High)

## Also check (Athena Creed alignment)

- **Explain** — can the reasoning be traced to evidence? (Creed line 2)
- **Challenge** — were alternatives considered? (Creed line 3)
- **Measure** — is success verifiable? (Creed line 4)
- **Human wisdom** — does this augment, not replace, human judgment? (Creed line 5)

See `zoo-athena-doctrine.mdc` for full Canon Test.

- Throwaway prototypes
- Documentation-only changes
- Explicit user request — state reason
